    "blurb": "Tailored Camunda 8 migration services",
    "overview": "Plan and deliver your Camunda 8 migration with cimt's three-phase framework, from readiness and strategy to pilot implementation, scaling, and support.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "cimt Migration Framework",
    "splashDescription": "cimt plans and delivers Camunda 8 migrations that fit your technology stack and teams. Together, we assess your processes for Camunda 8 readiness, define a migration strategy, and build a practical roadmap. Then we run a pilot, implement job workers and connectors, and help you scale on Camunda 8 SaaS or Self-Managed environments. With 16 years of experience, Camunda Platinum Partner status, and OCEB 2 (OMG Certified Expert in BPM) certified consultants, cimt helps you move beyond 1:1 conversion to a sustainable foundation for long-term use of Camunda 8.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/786674/overview/img15840165809399207234.png?c0144708a7c0aa35cb8025440e2d05fd",
